WEBVTT

00:03:29.341 --> 00:03:31.583
Na hili wazo nililokuwa nalo

00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:34.114
wakati nikiwa mtoto,nimekuwa nalo kwa muda sana

00:03:34.114 --> 00:03:36.024
hadi nikiwa mtu mzima,

00:03:36.024 --> 00:03:38.471
ni zao ambalo wanasaikolojia wanaita

00:03:38.471 --> 00:03:39.935
upendeleo.

00:03:39.935 --> 00:03:43.209
Sasa upendeleo ni njia ambayo

00:03:43.209 --> 00:03:44.927
hufanya vitu kimakosa,

00:03:44.927 --> 00:03:47.611
njia ambazo tunakosea kukokotoa,kutoa maamuzi,

00:03:47.611 --> 00:03:51.200
kuharibu uhalisia,au kuona tunachotaka kuona,

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.432
na upendeleo ninaoongelea

00:03:53.432 --> 00:03:54.870
unafanya kazi kama hivi:

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:57.105
Kumfata mtu na ukweli

00:03:57.105 --> 00:03:58.652
kwamba atakufa

00:03:58.652 --> 00:04:01.685
na wataamini kuhusu hadithi yoyote